/
/ CHECK THAT A USER'S ARGUMENT IS IN THE ALLOWABLE RANGE
/
/
/ ON RETURN:	IF A VALID ARGUMENT WAS FOUND, THE LINK
/		  IS SET AND THE ARGUMENT IS IN THE AC.
/		IF NO ARGUMENT WAS FOUND, THE LINK AND
/		  THE ACCUMULATOR ARE CLEAR.
/		IF AN INVALID ARGUMENT WAS FOUND, WE
/		  EXIT THROUGH "ERROR".
/
/ CALLING SEQUENCE:
/
/	JMS ARGTST
/	  ARGFLAG	THE ARGUMENT FLAG TO TEST.
/	  LIMIT		THE MAXIMUM LEGAL VALUE FOR THE 
/			  ARGUMENT.
/
/
