	DCA ARGTA
	TAD I ARGTA	/WAS AN ARGUMENT ENTERED ?
	ISZ ARGTA
	SNA CLA
	JMP ARGT1	/NONE THERE, JUST EXIT.

	TAD I ARGTST	/GET THE CALLERS ARGUMENT LIMIT.
	SNA
	JMP I (ERROR	/A ZERO LIMIT SAYS NO ARGUMENT
			/ IS ALLOWED.
	CLL CMA
	TAD I ARGTA	/IS THE ARGUMENT WITHIN THE
	SZL CLA		/ ALLOWABLE LIMITS ?
	JMP I (ERROR	/NO, GO TELL THE USER HE GOOFED.

	CLB IAC		/NOW FORM A POINTER TO THE HIGH
	TAD ARGTA	/ ORDER WORD OF THIS ARGUMENT.
	DCA ARGTB
	TAD I ARGTB	/IS THE HIGH ORDER WORD ZERO ?
	SZA CLA
	JMP I (ERROR	/NO, NOW THAT'S NOT NICE.
	TAD I ARGTA	/YES, PUT THE ARGUMENT IN THE AC,
	STL		/SET THE LINK TO SAY WE HAVE
			/ DATA.

