	DCA SETUA	/SAVE THE BREAKPOINT INDEX.
	TAD SETUA	/COMPUTE THE ADDRESS OF THE BKP
	CLL RAL		/ IN THE BREAKPOINT TABLE, AND
	TAD (BKADDR)	/ SAVE IT FOR "MOVEDAT" TO USE.
	DCA SETU1
	TAD SETUA	/USE THE CALLER'S INDEX AGAIN
	TAD (BKUINT)	/ TO SET UP A POINTER TO THE
	DCA SETUA	/ INSTRUCTION WE WANT TO PUT
			/ BACK IN THE USER'S TASK.

	JMS I (MOVEDAT	/MOVE THE BREAKPOINT ADDRESS TO
SETU1,	  0000		/ "CADDR".
	  CADDR
	JMS I (GETCAD	/GET THE INSTRUCTION AT THE BKP,
	TAD I (CDATA	/ AND CHECK THAT IT IS THE
	TAD (-CALODT)	/ BREAKPOINT INSTRUCTION !
	JMP I SETUBK	/RETURN.

SETUA,	0		/LOCAL TEMPORARY.

