/
/
/
LOGBKP,	0
	JMS I (LGNAME	/START THE LINE WITH OUR NAME.
	JMS I (PSPACE	/AND A SPACE.
	TAD I LOGBKP	/COMPUTE THE BREAKPOINT INDEX,
	ISZ LOGBKP
	TAD (30)	/ AND OUTPUT IT.
	JMS I (PSPACE
	TAD ("B)	/ADD A "B" TO SAY BREAKPOINT.
	JMS I (PUTBUF

	JMS I (PSPACE	/AND ANOTHER SPACE.
	AC7777
	TAD I LOGBKP
	ISZ LOGBKP
	DCA BKPSY
	JMS I (MOVEDAT	/
BKPSY,	  0000
	  CADDR
	JMS I (PRTADR
	TAD I LOGBKP	/NO, NOW GO OUTPUT THE ACTIVE
	ISZ LOGBKP
	JMS I (TSKLST	/ REGISTER DATA FOR THIS TASK.
	JMP I LOGBKP	/RETURN.

