	DCA I (SIMADR	/SAVE PAGE RELATIVE ADDRESS.

	TAD I (SIMIST	/FORM THE EFFECTIVE ADDRESS.
	AND (0200)
	CIA
	AND I (SIMPC	/GET THE PAGE ADDRESS AND ADD
