	DCA I (SIMADR
 
	TAD I (SIMSAT	/IF NO INDIRECT ADDRESSING, THE
			/ OPERAND FIELD IS THE TASK'S
			/ CURRENT INSTRUCTION FIELD.
    IFZERO KT8A <
	AND (0070)	/OLD 32K STYLE.
    >
    IFNZRO KT8A <
	RACC		/KT8A STYLE.
